WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:07.738
Roxy called Terrell to tell him she couldn't join her friends.

2
00:00:07.739 --> 00:00:12.417
Then she flew to the canning factory.

3
00:00:12.418 --> 00:00:14.558
Boxes were stacked near a wall.

4
00:00:14.559 --> 00:00:17.876
Rusty cans and tools lay on the floor.

5
00:00:17.877 --> 00:00:22.613
"Hello?" Roxy shouted. "Is anyone here?"

6
00:00:22.614 --> 00:00:26.163
Nobody answered.

7
00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:28.791
Roxy flew around.

8
00:00:28.792 --> 00:00:32.375
The building was empty.

9
00:00:32.376 --> 00:00:33.824
She scratched her head.

10
00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:36.171
"I don't think there's an emergency here.

11
00:00:36.172 --> 00:00:38.047
Mayor Bloom made a mistake."

12
00:00:38.048 --> 00:00:40.020
She flew toward the exit.

13
00:00:40.021 --> 00:00:43.490
Bam! The door slammed shut.

14
00:00:43.491 --> 00:00:48.125
Roxy spun around. "Who closed the—?" Roxy gasped.

15
00:00:48.126 --> 00:00:51.492
Boxes, cans, and tools floated in the air.

16
00:00:51.493 --> 00:00:54.537
A dark figure floated into the room.

17
00:00:54.538 --> 00:00:57.310
Shiny material covered its face.

18
00:00:57.311 --> 00:00:59.383
Roxy saw her reflection in it.

19
00:00:59.384 --> 00:01:02.932
"Who are you?" Roxy said.

20
00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:06.994
"Call me Brain Invader," the figure said.

21
00:01:06.995 --> 00:01:09.922
"I know your voice," Roxy said.

22
00:01:09.923 --> 00:01:11.924
"It was in my head!"

23
00:01:11.925 --> 00:01:14.305
"Yes," Brain Invader said.

24
00:01:14.306 --> 00:01:16.641
"I can get in people's minds.

25
00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:19.177
I made Rumbler rob that bank.

26
00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:22.514
And I made Mayor Bloom send you here."

27
00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:26.615
"Why?" Roxy asked. "What do you want?"

28
00:01:26.616 --> 00:01:29.192
"It's simple," Brain Invader said.

29
00:01:29.193 --> 00:01:31.329
"I want to take over the world.

30
00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.372
And I want you to help me."

31
00:01:34.373 --> 00:01:39.427
"Never!" Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

32
00:01:39.428 --> 00:01:41.219
Brain Invader vanished.

33
00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.606
The laser beams hit the wall.

34
00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:47.696
Roxy heard the villain laugh.

35
00:01:47.697 --> 00:01:50.201
"Did I disappear?" he asked.

36
00:01:50.202 --> 00:01:53.420
"Or did I just make you think I disappeared?"

37
00:01:53.421 --> 00:01:55.163
Roxy blinked.

38
00:01:55.164 --> 00:01:58.217
Brain Invader was still floating in the air.

39
00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.190
Roxy flew toward him.

40
00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.591
But as she flew, the room seemed to stretch.

41
00:02:04.592 --> 00:02:07.644
Now the villain was farther away.

42
00:02:07.645 --> 00:02:10.854
"The room is getting bigger!" Roxy thought.

43
00:02:10.855 --> 00:02:13.745
Suddenly Brain Invader appeared next to her.

44
00:02:13.746 --> 00:02:18.477
"Is it getting bigger? Or am I just making it look like that?

45
00:02:18.478 --> 00:02:26.144
How do you know we're even in a room?"

46
00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:28.413
Roxy's eyes went wide.

47
00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.055
The room was gone.

48
00:02:30.056 --> 00:02:34.383
A thick jungle surrounded her.

49
00:02:34.384 --> 00:02:38.459
Roar! A tiger leaped toward Roxy.

50
00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.555
"Ahh!" Roxy fell to the ground.

51
00:02:41.556 --> 00:02:45.101
"Oof!" She hit a machine.

52
00:02:45.102 --> 00:02:47.385
The tiger and the jungle were gone.

53
00:02:47.386 --> 00:02:50.000
She was in the room again.

54
00:02:50.001 --> 00:02:53.400
"You're strong, Rocket Girl," Brain Invader said.

55
00:02:53.401 --> 00:02:56.063
"That's why your mind is difficult to control."

56
00:02:56.064 --> 00:02:58.250
His voice was in her head again.

57
00:02:58.251 --> 00:03:02.587
"Join me, Rocket Girl. I have mind powers.

58
00:03:02.588 --> 00:03:08.226
You have super powers. Together we'll take over the world!"

59
00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:11.361
"I'll never join you," Roxy said.

60
00:03:11.362 --> 00:03:14.405
"You don't know how powerful I am!"

61
00:03:14.406 --> 00:03:17.933
"I know everything about you," Brain Invader said.

62
00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:22.003
"I can see all of your memories. I'll show you."

63
00:03:22.004 --> 00:03:25.080
Roxy's eyes closed.

64
00:03:25.081 --> 00:03:31.484
She fell to the floor.

